en:
"Hey, you made it!
Have you offered the three Phantom Stones
at their altars?"{w}

"Yorfa, please understand."{w}{p}"From here, I can shine down on everyone's smiling faces.
There's no greater joy than that. Isn't that right?"{w}{p}"When the sun was lost, the land was shrouded in darkness for a long while."{w}{p}"In that darkness, no one could find any light of hope, and sorrow covered the land."{w}{p}"But I rose into the sky, and made it a place overflowing with smiles and life."{w}{p}"There's no greater joy than this!
You were happy about it too, Yorfa!"{w}

"Even if this body of mine is destroyed,
I want to go on shining on the land
until the very last moment."{w}

"I will have you leave behind what you hold in your hands."{w}{p}"Hmph... As you can see, it is a worthless thing.
Surely you do not wish to die for something like that?"{w}{p}"Do as you are told,
and I shall let you die without suffering..."{w}

"I am Shaharon.
The next time we meet,
you will come to know your own folly..."{w}

"Heh... I see...
So you would boldly choose the road to death."{w}{p}"How amusing...
Then I shall help you to your deaths myself."{w}

{0E}"Ugh, honestly! You're all exaggerating!
If someone's in trouble, I help them.{0F}
That's only natural, right?"{w}

{0E}"One way or another, you guys sure know a lot...
I really do need to study.{0F}
And I have to work harder at alchemy, too..."{w}

{0E}"Ninja! Ninja's the way to go!
YAMURU IS DECAPITATED!{0F}
*ding* R.I.P.!"{w}

"You can just go end up
    *INSIDE THE STONE*
all by yourself!"{w}

{0E}"Those two make an Angel's Window...
I know that one, since I've made it before.{0F}
And then Ma... Mazu... Mazu-ree-tay?"{w}

{0E}"Yamuru!{0F}
...It's all right, okay?"{w}{p}"If I wanted to change classes, I wouldn't be studying alchemy.{w}I'm studying like this because
I decided to keep at it, see?"{w}
